WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.732
An astronaut with gray hair in black shirt and blue gloves tends plants in ISS module.

2
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:17.045
A gray-haired astronaut in black shirt and blue gloves adjusts green plants in growth chamber.

3
00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:27.914
A gray-haired technician in black shirt and blue gloves lifts seedling from dark tray.

4
00:00:33.977 --> 00:00:38.990
The astronaut adjusts leaf cluster under bright lamp inside ISS growth chamber.

5
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:51.086
The technician with gray hair and blue gloves adjusts the green foliage near a bright lamp inside.

6
00:00:56.574 --> 00:01:01.775
The technician lifts a red chili pepper and places it beside a small white label.

7
00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:13.309
The technician films the chili pepper attached to a black surface using a handheld camera.

8
00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:29.743
The crew member gathers a sample of green plants in the growth chamber and photographs them.

9
00:01:32.723 --> 00:01:39.789
Astronauts float together in an ISS module, reaching toward a central green plant while one person films.

10
00:01:41.321 --> 00:01:46.116
The gray-haired astronaut tending plants offers a sample onto a cutting board.
